{"ID":"20230928085009-ba07jyo","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20230928085009-ba07jyo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085009-ba07jyo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085014-0pl4cg7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085124-8e5g0hb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:89,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085124-8e5g0hb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【手阳明大肠经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173355"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912164557-0sofn0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912164557-0sofn0x","updated":"20240912173257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【手阳明大肠经穴位】：商阳穴、二间穴、三间穴、合谷穴、阳溪穴、偏历穴、温溜穴、下廉穴、上廉穴、手三里穴、曲池穴、肘髎穴、手五里穴、臂臑穴、肩髃穴、巨骨穴、天鼎穴、扶突穴、口禾髎穴、迎香穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-0pl4cg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-0pl4cg7","updated":"20230928085020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳经："}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-pilx1kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-pilx1kx","updated":"20230928085021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t金\t\t商阳穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-4v2fuhf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-4v2fuhf","updated":"20230928085021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t水\t\t二间穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-pzumx0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-pzumx0x","updated":"20230928085022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t木\t\t三间穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-232yog3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-232yog3","updated":"20230928085022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t火\t\t阳溪穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-91f0tl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-91f0tl8","updated":"20230928085023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t土\t\t曲池穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085015-ntvkn8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085015-ntvkn8r"}},{"ID":"20230928085014-3fwg2e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-3fwg2e8","updated":"20230928085024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手阳明大肠经歌诀："}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-ll325xm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-ll325xm","updated":"20230928085024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手中阳明始商阳，二间三间合谷藏。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-tv9kn6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-tv9kn6f","updated":"20230928085025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳溪偏历及温溜，下廉上廉三里长。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-mp0hqtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-mp0hqtc","updated":"20230928085026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"曲池肘髎迎五里，臂臑肩髃巨骨地。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-72f3lpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-72f3lpn","updated":"20230928085026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天鼎扶突口禾髎，终止迎香二十穴。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-clu5bui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-clu5bui","updated":"20230928085027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺与大肠相表里，肺是脏，脏就是里，大肠是腑，腑就是表；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-cowa4x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-cowa4x7","updated":"20230928085027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手阳明大肠经经过上门牙的牙齿，所以牙齿痛是上牙痛时下合谷穴（遵守对称治疗原则，上牙左边痛时扎右边合谷，上牙右边痛时扎左边合谷，左右痛则两边都扎）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-z7rtwjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-z7rtwjv","updated":"20230928085030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"偏历穴：手阳明大肠经络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-xjvwf1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-xjvwf1w","updated":"20230928085031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"温溜穴：手阳明大肠经郄穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085014-gzkar3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085014-gzkar3g","updated":"20230928085032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天枢穴：手阳明大肠经募穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085033-7w0pt8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085033-7w0pt8v"}},{"ID":"20230928085034-fzi7zra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085034-fzi7zra"}},{"ID":"20230928085115-a6r3n3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085115-a6r3n3f","updated":"20230928085115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手阳明大肠经1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手阳明大肠经1-20230928085115-l8ask08.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928085120-9a9spn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085120-9a9spn5","updated":"20230928085120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"手阳明大肠经2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/手阳明大肠经2-20230928085120-bowokms.gif"},{"